<title>USA: Andal Corp to sell Multi-Arc unit.</title>
<headline>Andal Corp to sell Multi-Arc unit.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKAWAY, N.J. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andal Corp said on Wednesday that it had agreed to sell its Multi-Arc Inc unit to Swiss conglomerate Saurer Gruppe Holding AG, for $29.2 million in cash.</p>
<p>Andal owns about 82 percent of Multi-Arc, with the remaining 18 percent owned principally by Andal management.</p>
<p>Andal specified that portions of the purchase price will be used to pay the sellers' expenses for the deal, as well as to establish escrows required under the agreement.     Multi-Arc</p>
<p>is a provider of thin film metal coating services, while Saurer makes textile machinery and automobile components.</p>
</text>
